GRANT READ, WRITE ON FILE TO x
GRANT READ, WRITE ON * TO x
GRANT READ ON FILE TO x
GRANT WRITE ON S3 TO x
GRANT READ, WRITE ON FILE TO x
GRANT READ ON FILE, READ ON S3 TO x
REVOKE READ, WRITE ON FILE FROM x
GRANT READ, WRITE ON S3 TO x
GRANT READ, WRITE ON URL TO x
GRANT READ, WRITE ON HDFS TO x
GRANT SELECT(a), SELECT(b) ON db.t TO x
GRANT SELECT(a, b), INSERT(c) ON db.t TO x
GRANT SELECT, SELECT(a) ON db.t TO x
GRANT SELECT(a) ON db.t1, SELECT(b) ON db.t2 TO x
